        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "The residents of Whittleton Creek have all pitched in 500,000$ for the ICA to take out various nuisances around the town, currently making the quality of life miserable.  The residents have requested as many murders as possible be accidents to hopefully mask their involvement. \r\r\rHarming any non-target Whittleton Creek resident will result in all other residents pulling their funding and voiding the contract.\r\r\rGood luck,47.",
